# Backups
Primarily want a shared jellyfin backup.
Slskd is pretty much all managed by env variables which is nice.
Nicotine is probably worth it to backup as well.

# LVM
Just want a simple role to create the LVM cache and scratch drives in /mnt/nas and /mnt/scratch.
Easiest to hardcode the disk UUIDs for this.

# Tailscale
I setup a basic role to add tailscale0 to the trusted zone. We can actually
relatively easily setup automatic install/bringup of tailscale with an oauth
client. Looks like there's an existing collection we can use for this? Maybe
overkill.
